<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress Semiconductor.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co Inc said it cut its 1997 earnings view on Cypress Semiconductor Corp to $0.80 a share from $1.30 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate at $1.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- said continues to rate Cypress as outperform.</p>
<p>-- Cypress gained 5/8 to 13-1/2 in late morning trading.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
